                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A cute, charming little puzzle game that doesn't let difficulty bloat it's runtime - which is a nice change of pace. True, the game isn't exactly difficult - with a reasonable amount of planning you can complete this in an hour, but honestly? It's refreshing to play a game like this once in a while, help you reset from a lot of intense or long-time goal based games. I had a great time watching my little guy slide around and solving the puzzles, and I think you will too.",
